+  // DOS-PORT (patch 0296, Path B): direct-VESA is a FULL-surface present
+  // -- SDL_DOSVesaDirectPresentFull pushes fb_size bytes and SDL/0034
+  // exposes no rect variant. On an oversized surface that is the whole
